The mesh files in this directory (*.glb, *.ply) and the kinematic chain in
../roarm_m3.json and ../roarm_m3_mesh.json are derived from the RoArm-M3
description published by Waveshare in the roarm_description ROS 2 package:

  https://github.com/waveshareteam/roarm_ws  (branch ros2-humble, commit 40dbd84)
  src/roarm_main/roarm_description/urdf/roarm_m3/roarm_m3.xacro
  src/roarm_main/roarm_description/meshes/roarm_m3/*.stl

That package declares in its package.xml:

  <license>MIT</license>

The original STL files are not redistributed here; these artifacts are
generated from them by cmd/genmeshes (welded, transformed into this module's
link frames, and for the collision meshes hull-decimated).
